{"version":"1.4.0-alpha.1","notes":"## 1.4.0-alpha.1 - 2026-10-22\n\n### Features\n\n- Include desktop preferences in configuration backups and add recovery guidance with confirmation before replacing a preserved failed import (#2061)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Keep existing configuration backup files intact when a new export fails (#2061)\n- Prevent the Windows app from showing an error screen during startup when reduced motion is enabled (#2066)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 1.4.0-alpha.1 - 2026-10-22\n\n### Features\n\n- 配置备份现在包含桌面偏好设置，并提供导入失败后的恢复指引，替换保留的导入数据前需单独确认 (#2061)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复配置导出失败时可能损坏已有备份文件的问题 (#2061)\n- 修复 Windows 下启用减少动态效果时，应用启动可能显示错误页面的问题 (#2066)","confirmation_required":false,"confirmation_description":null,"pub_date":"2026-10-22T07:11:47Z","platforms":{"linux-aarch64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.4.0-alpha.1/UniClipboard_1.4.0-alpha.1_aarch64.AppImage.tar.gz"},"linux-x86_64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.4.0-alpha.1/UniClipboard_1.4.0-alpha.1_amd64.AppImage.tar.gz"},"windows-aarch64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.4.0-alpha.1/UniClipboard_1.4.0-alpha.1_arm64-setup.exe"},"windows-x86_64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.4.0-alpha.1/UniClipboard_1.4.0-alpha.1_x64-setup.exe"},"darwin-aarch64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.4.0-alpha.1/UniClipboard_aarch64-apple-darwin.app.tar.gz"},"darwin-x86_64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.4.0-alpha.1/UniClipboard_x86_64-apple-darwin.app.tar.gz"}}}